	o UpdateConfigs - Realtime Config Updating utility. Will
	  reset the configurations of -
		o File Areas    - done
		o Message Areas - done
		o General Msg   - done
		o Editors       - done
		o Baudrates     - done
		o Xpr Protocols - done
		o Archivers     - done
		o SIGS          - done
	o Recompiled all, for the new User Struct/ControlCodes.
	o New Script MsgAreaList.pl for listing Message Areas.
	o New Controlcodes %2032-%2039. Changed format of CCs
	  %2030-2031, see PlMsgCc.Doc
	o Change ChangeMsgArea.Pl, ChangeFileArea.Pl
	o Four new conditional ControlCodes %2100-%2103.

Version 0.107
-------------

	o UserEditor -- Access Gadgets working.
	o New library function -- AddMsgBase.

Version 0.108
-------------

	o Default Origin Button now works in PlMsgCfg
	o Changed Message Area Config format --
		o Run MsgCfgConv to convert from previous version.
		o New fields -- UseNet follow-up base.
		o 		-- Message Base Libraries
		o		-- Minimum Age to access Base.
		o		-- Gender to access Base.
	o New Program ChangeBaseLib.
