	o Recompiled for new Pipeline version.
	o Far too many changes to mention, see 200994.displayme.

Version 0.109
-------------

	o New Controlcode %2060 (Editor Name).
	o New Script -- Options/BBS.pl
	o Removed all inbuild texts, you can now configure the names
	  of each type of message area (Local/Echomail etc.), see
	  "Pipeline:Config/Language/Default.Lang"
	o Changed Editor Structure.
	o Rewrote Editors Configuration program.
	o Fixed the XenoMsgConv and XenoFileConv Configuration programs.
	  An Area '0' should not be present in either configuration.
	o New Editor Structure. Please delete old one, and copy over
	  included 'Editors.Cfg' with this update.
	o New library function "ParseFidoAddr". Removes need for the
	  traplist.library.
	o New REXX function - SetMsgData (see PlMsgRexx.Guide).
	o New REXX script - Quest.pl, a new-user questionairre.
	o Removed Stack and EXE fields from editor structure.
	o Added new argument to Rexxcommands/GetEditor - TAG. See
	  plmsgrexx.guide
	o Removed Rexxcommands/ReplyMsg. SetMsgData now handles it.
	o IMPORTANT mb#?.library writers -- SaveMessage should return,
	  if successful, the number it saved the message as.
	o IMPORTANT mb#?.library writers -- WriteMsgStruct has changed
	  completely. Some of SAVEMESSAGE _must_ be re-written.
	  See plmsg.h source.
	o Cleared up Funccounter source in PlMsg.. should exit cleanly
	  now, if no REXX functions are active.
	o New ControlCode %2104 -- See CC Docs.
	o New CC %2044 - See Docs.
	o Added File Attach support for Messages. FileName should be
	  in Subject line.
	o Added Reply Linking when new messages are written.	
 	o Added Message Processing. Processor field in PlMsgCfg->
	  EditArea now works. To run Jive, add a field something
	  like.
		"execute S:JiveScr"

	  Create a file called JiveScr which contains
	--cut--
	  .key filename
	  .bra {
	  .ket }
	  Copy {filename} t:TempJive
	  Delete {filename}
	  Jive <t:TempJive >{filename}
	--cut--

	o Re-did MsgStats to use topaz.font, and cleared up dodgy text
	  positioning.
	o Fixed extra character bug in DisplayMsg.
	o ^MSGID, ^PID and ^REPLY kludges now saved as appropriate.
	o New REXX function - GetMsgData. See plmsgrexx.guide
	o New Language strings - TOANONYMOUS & FROMANONYMOUS. Attach
	  included file "NewLang" to bottom of your language files.
	o Anonymous FROM & TO fields supported.
	o New program -- ZeusTag.. adds a random quote from your
	  favourite quote list onto the bottom of a message. Use
	  in Text Processor Field in PlMsgCfg->EditArea.
          Example String :
		Pipeline:Bin/ZeusTag Pipeline:Quotes.Doc DIVIDER %% (% dividers)
            or  Pipeline:Bin/ZeusTag Pipeline:Quotelist.Doc         (newline dividers)

	o UpdateConfigs MSG now closes and re-opens the mb libraries.
	o Updated Writemsg.src to handle new Editor Code.
	o Updated ReadMsg.src  "    "     "    "      "
	o Message Text _must_ now comply to standard FidoNet text
	  format (i.e. '\r' paragraph breaks, ignored '\n's)
	o New Editor SimpleEd, replaces LineEditor.
	o SimpleEd now deletes Command line file if Abort is hit.

Version 0.110
-------------

	o pipeutil.library now creates Waiting Mail file and notifies
          online users of waiting mail. Use 'WaitMail' tag in your
          language structure.

Version 0.111
-------------

	o mbstarmsg.library -- No Pointer Update now updates internal list.
