Version 0.113
-------------

	o Back writing the functions lost by the great crash of '94.
	o WriteMsg now takes <FileName> parameter.
	o Removed REXX function 'PrintMsgHdr'. Replace with a Display
	  statement.
	o JumpMsgArea [LAST] now works!
	o Improved DisplayMsg handling.
	o Re-did High Pointer System. Delete USER:#?/MsgPointers.Dat.
	  Now uses XData.
	o Overturned and optimised all the major structures.
	o Message Access now implemented.
	o Message Vars now saved: Messages Written, Messages Written,
	  Max Messages Per Day, Date of Last Message Written.
	o New XData tags: See zheaders.h for accessing them.
	o PlMsg now uses Asl library not Reqtools for important
	  requests.
	o Renamed PlMsg: MsgControl!
	o Changed Msg/ScanMsg.pl to use 1-line header format, looking
