	o Made QWK pack in background. (MW)
	o THOR port
	o New arguments HOLD/CRASH/HOLD and ROUTE in SetMsgData (MW).
	o Made GiveTemplates Async. Requires Line var.
	o Fixed problem with CheckWaitMail.pl (RK)
	o MsgConfig now has double click support (many).
	o Fixed a couple of CC bugs (SM).
	o Fixed "" bugs in ScanMsgs.pl (RK).
	o Fixed bug in PreRead/New Messages.
	o Fixed bug in ReadMsg/Last with deleted messages.
	o Wrote ChangeBaseLib.rexx.
	o Fixed bug in AddMsgArea causing corruption of message areas.
	o Fixed bug in SetMsgArea causing followup definitions not being
	  written.
	o Fixed that goddamn bugger line miss bug in DisplayMsg (trillions
	  of funksters). May I point out that this took me about nine
	  years of debugging, so I'm waiting for me beer!
	o Fixed up Thor/PackZeus.
	o Tidied up Msg/ReadMsg.pl
	o Included Chef and example configuration for it's use!
	o New script Zeus:Rexx/TheChef.rexx
	o Fixed Chrono-sort bug in UserEditor (SM).
	o New keyword in SetMsgData 'FROMADDRESS' <5d fido address> (GH)
	o Changed WriteMsg.pl with new GetMsgArea call.
	o Removed GetMsgAreaFlag command.
	o Added message config tags "Text Styles" and "ANSI Base" (many)
	o Added support for text styles (underline, bold, italic and 
	  reverse video) in DisplayMsg. Requires new tags.
	o Added new CC %2061 -- Current Editor number (VN)
	o Added new arguments to SetMsgArea/GetMsgArea (NO)TEXTSTYLES
	  and (NO)ANSIBASE.
	o New zmf.library function Validate( struct file * )
	o MoveFile() now deletes the original file. (RK)
	o New RenumberFiles program.
	o Fixed bug in FileRebuild.
	o Added new message and file area compiler and dump Arexx scripts.

Version 0.125
-------------

	o Fixed bug in Rexx/MsgTxtCfgDump.rexx causing first area to be
          ignored.
	o Forgot to include UpdateConfigs and AccessControl with update.
	o Make sure you have a Zeus:Config/Msg/ directory!
	o Forgot to include new QWK scripts for background packing!
	o Made Text Compilers reload the configurations. Previously
	  required a call to UpdateConfigs after a successful compile.
	o Forgot to include MsgMaint.
	o UpdateConfigs MA now loads Origins and Executables.
	o Executable list is now freed.
	o Doesn't copy Fido Address to LOCAL or BULLETIN bases.
	o Recompiled "PostMsg".
	o New Script 'Msg/globalnewread.zeus'
	o Recompiled QWK modules.

Version 0.126
-------------

	o Fixed cosmetic bug in DisplayMsg with preceeding text.
	o Altered DisplayMsg to not display Text Styles if the preceeding
           character is not a space or a text style character. Should
           make some improvements in signatures and path names in particular.
	o Fixed FreeMem() mismatch when freeing executable list (AM).
	o Changed WriteMsg.zeus to use new GetMsgArea commands.
	o Fixed loophole in Msg/MsgAreaList.pl (EN).
	o Removed references to Pipeline from Archivers and moved archivers
	   config. from Zeus:Config/Pipeline/ to Zeus:Config/Zeus/
	o Redesigned and finished off Archivers.
	o Added full vanillakey support to Prefs/Editors, restyled a GUI
	   and removed references to Pipeline.

Notes: New Include Files!

	o Moved Zeus:Config/PlMsg/Editors.Dat to Zeus:Config/Msg/

