Version 0.129
-------------

	o Msg Area list index now built for increased speed access of
	   areas.
	o MsgConfig->EditArea cancels the area if the CloseWindow button
	   is pressed (AH/VN).
	o Text Styles are now a bit cleverer, and don't mind Paul's
	   signature file. (PB).
	o Topic Read no longer allows you to see subject lines of
	   messages you may not read (e.g. private ones) (AM).
	o Added NOHEAD/S and NOTEXT/S keywords to ConvMsgToText (GH)
	o Added NOKLUDGES keyword to ConvMsgToText.
	o WriteMsg now increases the number of messages written and
	   saves the users data. (EO)
	o WriteMsg.zeus now checks for WRITE access in the area. (EO)
	o New script "Msg/MsgMasking.zeus"
	o New Arexx function "MaskMsgArea".
	o New script "Msg/MaskMsgArea.zeus"
	o Improved "Msg/ReadMsg.zeus" and "Msg/GlobalReadNew.zeus"
	o Made "Msg/GlobalReadNew.zeus" respect Masking of areas.
	o I just couldn't wait any longer! Wrote "PostMan" for Zeus,
	   in record breaking IRC speed! (VN/GS/KG challenge event.)
	o Made "Msg/FullRead" have an OR/AND option.
	o Added CC %2118.
	o Added arguments to SetMsgFilter 'AND' and 'OR'

Version 0.130
-------------

	o Fixed nasty in SetMsgArea with new index routines. (AM).
	o Fixed small problem with PostMsg IntuiText structures.

Version 0.131
-------------

	o Finished Archivers.
	o Finished Editors.

Version 0.132
-------------

	o GUIs are being revamped with the following criteria:

		- Default screentitle:
		   "Zeus Bulletin Board System (c)1992-1995 Alex May & Nick Loman"
		- ESC key closes window (CANCEL)
		- All gadgets should have Vanillakey options
		- Version strings set to v1.0 with todays date.
		- Gadget bounds should not exceed reasonable sizes/structure
		   sizes.
		- All gadgets should use readable text (Ok|Cancel, not OK|CANCEL).
		- No Window controls that are not usable (SizeWindows for example)
		- "Gutter" bevelboxes to enhance visual impact.
		- Programs should request confirmation of important changes.
		- PIPELINE pubscreen screen replaced with ZEUS
		- pipeline/util libraries replaced with zeus/zmf libraries.

	o Checklist:

		- Archivers       Done.
		- Editors         Done.
		- UserEditor      Done.
		- FileEditor      Done. 
		- File Areas      Done.
		- XPR Protocols   Done.
		- General File    Done.
		- Msg Areas       Done.
		- General Msg     Done.
		- Voyeur          Done.
		- QWK             Done.
		- SIGS         -redesign-
		- Templates       Done.

	o Fixed bugs with indexing in MsgControl.
	o Fixed problems with MsgTxtCfgCompiler.

Version 0.133
-------------

	o Improved Options/RIPTest.zeus
	o Fixed various bugs and recompiled QWK modules.
	o Fixed icon positioning bug in PostMan.
	o Recompiled QWK modules.
	o Msg/CheckWaitMail.zeus no longer shows messages in areas you
	   are masked out of. (GS)

Version 0.134
-------------

	o Msgconfig-General works again.
	o Added boopsi images into MsgConfig.
	o Added Msg SIG support into UserEditor.
	o Removed boopsi getfile image from UserEditor and replaces it with
	   standard buttons.
	o File and Message SIG's are now seperate, unless a SIG contains
	   both file and message areas. The new Message SIG's can be 
	   viewed with the new ControlCodes %2200-

Version 0.135
-------------

	o Added new flag to Message Area Config, "MaskOut", this flag
           specifies that the area should be set to Masked Out by
           default when added to the user structure via. AccessControl,
           GiveTemplates or UserEditor.
	o SetMsgFilter now sets InUse to FALSE if there is no filter
	   parameters defined.
	o Fixed bug in rexx/SetMsgData 'AREA'
	o New script "Msg/ForwardMsg.zeus"
	o New argument to SetMsgData 'FORWARD' [Area Number] [Message Number]
	o New language tags: DATE, HOURTIME, FULLDATE, FORWARDHDR, REPLYHDR
	o Reply headers and forward headers will be retrieved from RHDR and
	   FHDR if they exist.
	o SetMsgData 'REPLY' takes header details from REPLYHDR or xdata/RHDR.
	o New flag in messages, "MI_CROSSREPLY".
	o Fixed bug in DumpMsgText in non-async. mode (AM).
	o Fixed mask bug in CheckWaitMail (DN).

                  release: 06/09/95
full distribution release: 06/09/95

Version 0.136
-------------

	o Added new ARexx function "GetMsgInfo".
	o Moved MsgArea Configuration from Zeus:Config/PlMsg/ ->
	   Zeus:Config/Msg/
	o Moved FidoNet Address Configuration from Zeus:Config/PlMsg/ ->
	   Zeus:Config/Msg/
	o Moved General Msg Configuration from Zeus:Config/PlMsg/ ->
