	o .dat files are non-human readable configurations, .txt files
	   are human readable configuration files.
	o Fixed EVIL bug in zmf.library/LoadMessage() (RK).

Version 0.137
-------------

	o Fixed bug if there are no origin lines configured (EO).
	o ConvertMsgData now returns 5 if date is invalid.
	o DeleteWaitingMail now returns 10 if mail cannot be deleted,
		5 if mail file does not exist.
	o Added some new arguments to GetArchiver.
	o FreeMsg now returns 20 if UMD isn't found.
	o GetMsgAccess has new RC codes.
	o New argument for GetMsgArea "MASKOUT"
	o Fixed origin line bug in MsgConfig (EO).
	o Rewrote DlgConvertUsers.
	o DisplayMsg now allows punctuation characters inbetween text style
	   tags.
	o New language tag "AREABAD"
	o All message areas now have "serial numbers" for use with
	   DataManager. SetMsgArea now takes a new argument "SETRANDOM"
	   for use with creating these areas.
	o ForwardMsg doesn't check the SIG anymore.
	o New script "ForwardAreaList" for use with ForwardMsg.
	o PostMan will no longer run "MAILCMD" when the waiting mail file
	   is deleted.

